ics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":65,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"# WO-220203 — Pinned premise evidence bridge\n\n**BIU:** `WO-220203` — Wave 2 DAG node `U3`.\n\n**Source of truth:** [`docs/evidence/wave2-candidate-bius.json`](https://github.com/AlienLogicLab/alienintent/blob/2deec9351e9255091ec5d9d831ed9af2ecaefae1/docs/evidence/wave2-candidate-bius.json) at `origin/main` commit `2deec9351e9255091ec5d9d831ed9af2ecaefae1`, source blob `64c113e6788728be3930e1f5a300f83a96f5ec70`; approved DAG node `U3` in `docs/evidence/wave2-dependency-dag.json`. The pinned candidate contract governs.\n\n**Parent requirements:** `SF-REQ-014`, `SF-REQ-051`. **Lifecycle at materialization:** TASKS.\n\n## Intent and scope\n\nDeliver the bounded `premise_evidence_inputs` capability: read retained installation-doctor capability evidence through neutral typed inputs at composition, with positive target access, configured profile/resource scoping, rejected out-of-scope request, and unchanged outside-state readback. Missing premise is `InfeasibleProof`, never an invented credential denial.\n\n## Dependencies and acceptance\n\n`WO-220102` / S1 is completed and independently verified. Preserve its exact retained proof receipts.\n\nPin FX-U3 commands, inputs, expected outcomes, and evidence schema before implementation; demonstrate required intact/fault/restored discrimination. Use existing approved premise semantics and retained fixture data; do not adopt the withdrawn edge table.\n\n## Boundaries and gates\n\nOne DAG node and FX-U3 only. No general planning, source-authority migration, RAI wiring, external live action, provider calls, deployment, or sibling work.\n\nThis materialization is not READY or release. A fresh native Agent Ready assessment, explicit allocation/budget, exact baseline/profile binding, predecessor evidence, candidate custody, independent retrieval, and normal BIU verification/closure remain mandatory. No Wave 1 release authority carries over.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienLogicLab/alienintent/issues/81/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienLogicLab/alienintent/issues/81/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienLogicLab/alienintent/issues/comments/5810391605","html_url":"https://github.com/AlienLogicLab/alienintent/issues/83#issuecomment-5810391605","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlienLogicLab/alienintent/issues/83","id":5810391605,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUbjKuc8AAAABWlOKNQ","user":{"login":"sanookdu","id":272393288,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDxkSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/272393288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu","html_url":"https://github.com/sanookdu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanookdu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T08:11:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T08:11:24Z","body":"**Factory Director queue note** (episode `factory-director-eeb12163b1f84428bafed8b9f46ac7e9`, 2026-09-24). Founder order (Director inbox `founder-queue-order-20260924T080442Z`, now proces